#! mathcas 2 notebook

#% title
# polynomial_quotient_remainder

#% text
# `polynomial_quotient_remainder(p, q, x)` gives `[quotient, remainder]` of the polynomial `p` by `q` in `x`.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
polynomial_quotient_remainder(x^3 + 2*x + 1, x^2 + 1, x)
#% output
#= [x, 1 + x]

#% cell
polynomial_quotient_remainder(x^4 - 1, x - 1, x)
#% output
#= [1 + x + x^2 + x^3, 0]

#% section
# See also

#% text
# `polynomial_quotient`, `polynomial_remainder`
